    <h1>Welcome to the Deutschland Autohaus family</h1>
    <main>
      <div>
        <h4>What we are about</h4>
            <p class="text">
            Deutschland Autohaus is a well-known company established in 2017, by owner John Ayad, with years of experience serving the Inland Empire. Since then 
            Deutschland has served thousands of individuals with European vehicles, and still to this day, 
            has earned the trust and confidence of his peers and the community.
            </p>
        </div>

