                <div class="flex">
                <img class="makesBlue" src="/assets/images/pexels-photo-bluebmw.jpeg" alt="">
                <div class="info">
                <p class="paragraph">
                We Provide the most excellent service in the inland Empire when it comes to your vehicle,
                precision, accuracy, and dedication are our top priorities.
                </p>
                
                <ul>
                    <li class="list">Premium Service</li>
                    <li class="list">Oem parts and Support</li>
                    <li class="list">Customer Satisfaction</li>
                </ul>
                </div>
                </div>
            </div>

