  <div class="carousel-inner">
    <div class="carousel-item active">
      <!-- <img class="d-block w-100 carouselImage" src="/assets/images/pexels-photo-cxReview.jpeg" alt="First slide"> -->
      <div class="ff">
      <img class="d-block w-100 carouselImage" src="/assets/images/firstReview.jpg" alt="First slide">
      <p class="reviews">These guys are legit!! John makes it happen everytime without a doubt 
    I can drop the vehicle off and come back to it ready to go & a clean wash! 
    I appreciate these guys and all of their hard work they put in day in & day out.
    <span id="reviews">- Domonek “Domo” McDaniel</span></p>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div class="carousel-item">
      <img class="d-block w-100 carouselImage" src="/assets/images/secondReview.jpg" alt="Second slide">
      <p class="reviews">I’ve been going to John for years and I don’t trust any other shop with my bmw. He’s done it all and I always leave satisfied. Prices are best in the area and the communication and transparency is unlike anywhere else. If you have a German vehicle, Deutschland Autohaus is the spot!
      <!-- Services: General repairs & maintenance, Steering & suspension replacement, Auto brake repair, Engine repair, Oil change. -->
      <span id="reviews">- James Stephen</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="carousel-item">
      <img class="d-block w-100 carouselImage" src="/assets/images/sixthReview.jpg" alt="Third slide">
      <p class="reviews">Changed out the spark plugs today on my bmw. Will be returning for the air pump replacement shortly.Knowledgable owner and good mechanic. Thanks guys.
      <span id="reviews">- Nicole Bergmin</span></p>
    </div>
  

    <div class="carousel-item">
      <img class="d-block w-100 carouselImage" src="/assets/images/fifthReview.jpg" alt="Third slide">
      <p class="reviews">John is so honest and helpful. I originally took my car to All Day Auto (don’t go there). Deutchland easily fixed all the mistakes that the other mechanic made. John knows his stuff with Volkswagens. The prices are reasonable and I feel safer knowing that they specialize in German cars. Would definitely recommend!
      <span id="reviews">- Katie Everswick</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="carousel-item">
      <img class="d-block w-100 carouselImage" src="/assets/images/fourthReview.jpg" alt="Third slide">
      <p class="reviews">These guys were awesome! They legit diagnosed my Subaru and helped me to get the part I needed to pass my car for smog without having to spend thousands and thousands of dollars on parts. The team service I received was very friendly and very informative on what they were doing, which I appreciated a lot. If I had to go back to this auto shop for more work on my car, I wouldn't hesitate to do it again.
      <span id="reviews">- Sagat Uppercut77</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="carousel-item">
      <img class="d-block w-100 carouselImage" src="/assets/images/thirdReview.jpg" alt="Third slide">
      <p class="reviews">2006 BMW 325i Took car in for the famous oil pan gasket leak, and to have new motor mounts installed. The price was cheaper than other simular shops, and John and his crew were great. Deutschland Autohaus is my go to BMW repair shop, great job and thank you.
      <span id="reviews">- Donald Burd</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

